<body>
<div class="container">
<header><div><div class="eyebrow">AI INPUT LAB / MOUSE ONLY</div><h1>Right-hand mouse simulator</h1><p>Test the AI mouse directly in your browser. Human-constrained movement, visible held buttons, mousepad regrips, and screen-pointer recentering through ordinary relative movement—no installation needed.</p></div><span class="pill">● BROWSER SIMULATION</span></header>
<div class="layout">
<section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><div class="cardhead"><strong>VIRTUAL MOUSEPAD</strong><span>320 × 240 mm</span></div>
<div id="pad" class="pad" aria-label="Virtual mousepad; drag here to move mouse">
<div class="reach"></div><span class="axis">0,0 · PAD</span><span class="axis end">MOVEMENT SURFACE</span>
<div class="mouse" id="mouse" style="left:50%;top:50%">
<svg viewBox="0 0 100 160" role="img" aria-label="Mouse and right hand"><path class="shell" d="M50 3 C19 3 9 31 9 75 L9 111 C9 142 26 156 50 156 C74 156 91 142 91 111 L91 75 C91 31 81 3 50 3Z"/><path id="leftMouse" class="leftBtn" d="M49 5 C21 6 12 31 12 71 L49 71Z"/><path id="rightMouse" class="rightBtn" d="M52 5 C79 6 88 31 88 71 L52 71Z"/><path d="M10 72 H90" stroke="#a4c2d1" pointer-events="none"/><g class="hand" pointer-events="none"><path d="M28 151 C31 131 37 115 54 112 C74 108 84 124 96 151 L103 177 L53 183Z"/><path d="M28 140 C25 113 23 62 24 36 C24 28 35 25 38 35 C40 46 39 101 49 136Z"/><path d="M46 137 C46 111 49 56 53 29 C55 21 67 22 68 32 C69 47 61 105 69 140Z"/><path d="M66 145 C67 111 73 65 77 51 C80 43 91 47 90 58 C88 78 81 117 88 151Z"/></g><rect class="wheel" x="44" y="28" width="12" height="30" rx="6"/><path d="M50 7 V24" stroke="#b1cbd7" stroke-width="1.8" pointer-events="none"/></svg>
</div></div>
<div class="padstat"><div class="chip">X <b id="x">160.0</b> mm</div><div class="chip">Y <b id="y">120.0</b> mm</div><div class="chip">MOUSE <b class="up" id="contact">ON PAD</b></div><div class="chip">PHASE <b id="phase">READY</b></div></div>
<div class="toolrow"><button class="primary" id="demo">▶ Demo: drag to edge</button><button id="regrip">↗ Lift + recenter mouse on pad</button><button id="reset" class="ghost">↺ Reset</button><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="autoregrip" checked>Auto-regrip on AI moves</label></div>
<p class="hint">Drag anywhere on the pad to move the physical mouse. Toggle a mouse button to hold it during movement. Lift, drag the mouse to a new position, then place it; the game cursor must not move during the lift.</p>
</div></section>
<aside class="right"><section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><h2>Mouse buttons</h2><p class="note">Click to toggle a continuous hold. Left and right states are independent.</p><div class="twocol"><button class="hold left" id="leftControl" aria-pressed="false">◉ LEFT CLICK<small id="leftLabel">UP / RELEASED</small></button><button class="hold right" id="rightControl" aria-pressed="false">◉ RIGHT CLICK<small id="rightLabel">UP / RELEASED</small></button></div><div class="controlLabel">Physical contact</div><div class="twocol"><button class="amber" id="lift">↑ Lift</button><button id="place">↓ Place</button></div><div class="controlLabel">Test movement</div><div class="direction"><button class="none" disabled></button><button id="moveUp">↑ 80 mm</button><button class="none" disabled></button><button id="moveLeft">← 120 mm</button><button id="moveDown">↓ 80 mm</button><button id="moveRight">120 mm →</button></div></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><h2>Screen cursor preview</h2><div class="screenrow"><label for="resolution">Simulated screen:</label><select id="resolution"><option value="1920x1080">1920 × 1080</option><option value="1280x720">1280 × 720</option><option value="2560x1440">2560 × 1440</option><option value="800x600">800 × 600</option></select></div><div class="game" id="game"><svg class="trail" id="trail" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline id="trailLine" points="" fill="none" stroke="#64e9c4" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><div class="cross" id="cross" style="left:50%;top:50%"></div><div class="edgeIndicator" id="edgeIndicator">CENTER</div></div><div class="toolrow" style="margin-top:10px"><button class="primary" id="centerScreen">⌖ Recenter screen cursor</button></div><p class="gameTip">Recenter screen cursor moves the physical mouse to the screen center using relative mouse counts and automatic regrips; it does not teleport. Lift + recenter mouse on pad changes only hand position. The green pointer stops at screen edges and corners. Further movement is discarded there; lifting does not move it. Raw mouse counts below are separate from actual cursor position.</p><div class="counts" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="metric"><label>Raw ΔX counts</label><b id="countX">0</b></div><div class="metric"><label>Raw ΔY counts</label><b id="countY">0</b></div><div class="metric"><label>Cursor X (px)</label><b id="cursorX">960</b></div><div class="metric"><label>Cursor Y (px)</label><b id="cursorY">540</b></div><div class="metric"><label>Discarded X (counts)</label><b id="clippedX">0</b></div><div class="metric"><label>Discarded Y (counts)</label><b id="clippedY">0</b></div></div></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><div class="cardhead"><strong>INPUT EVENT LOG</strong><button class="small ghost" id="export">Export JSON</button></div><ul class="log" id="log"><li>Ready · browser only</li></ul></div></section></aside>
</div>
<div class="below"><section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><h2>Send an AI command (JSON)</h2><p class="note">Enter a command and press Run. These are identical to the commands available via the JavaScript API.</p><textarea class="codein" id="command" spellcheck="false">{"type":"move","dx_mm":240,"dy_mm":0,"auto_regrip":true}</textarea><div class="toolrow"><button class="primary small" id="execute">▶ Run command</button><button class="small" id="sampleHold">Example: hold + drag</button><button class="small" id="sampleLift">Example: lift</button></div><div class="status" id="status">Ready to receive AI commands.</div></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="cardbody"><h2>AI JavaScript API</h2><p class="note">Open browser DevTools → Console and send commands directly:</p><pre class="example">await mouseAI.down('left');
await mouseAI.move(240, 0);
await mouseAI.up('left');
await mouseAI.lift();
await mouseAI.relocate(160, 120);
await mouseAI.place();
    await mouseAI.centerScreen(); // screen pointer center by mouse motion
    mouseAI.state(); // bounded game_cursor: {x,y,edge}
await mouseAI.screen(1280,720);</pre><p class="note" style="margin-bottom:0">Also available: <code>mouseAI.run({type:'...'})</code>, <code>mouseAI.demo()</code>, <code>mouseAI.reset()</code> and <code>mouseAI.events()</code>.</p></div></section></div>
<footer>This is a local visual simulation, not OS or game control. The simulated desktop cursor is bounded to the selected screen resolution; raw relative mouse counts can still accumulate after it reaches an edge. Screen cursor recentering moves the mouse; it is not an OS cursor warp. Games that capture raw relative input (for example FPS camera control) may behave differently. Movement uses a minimum-jerk approximation, not a verified anatomical hand model.</footer>
</div>
<script>
(()=>{
'use strict';
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
const PAD={w:320,h:240,minX:23,maxX:297,minY:34,maxY:206},DPI=800,MAX_SPEED=650,MAX_ACCEL=3600,MAX_JERK=55000,TICK=12;
const sleep=ms=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms));
const clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.min(b,Math.max(a,v));
class MouseLab {
 constructor(){this.x=160;this.y=120;this.lifted=false;this.left=false;this.right=false;this.dx=0;this.dy=0;this.fx=0;this.fy=0;this.screen={width:1920,height:1080};this.gameX=960;this.gameY=540;this.clippedX=0;this.clippedY=0;this.edgeNotice='';this.phase='ready';this.queue=Promise.resolve();this.pending=0;this.epoch=0;this.history=[];this.trail=[[960,540]];this.downAt={left:0,right:0};this.upAt={left:0,right:0};this.note('Ready · screen-bounded cursor');this.render();}
 note(message,kind='event'){this.history.unshift({at:new Date().toLocaleTimeString('en-GB',{hour12:false}),kind,message});this.history.length=Math.min(this.history.length,160);this.renderLog();}
 state(){return {pad_mm:{width:PAD.w,height:PAD.h},mouse:{x_mm:+this.x.toFixed(3),y_mm:+this.y.toFixed(3),lifted:this.lifted},buttons:{left:this.left,right:this.right},screen:{...this.screen},relative_counts:{dx:this.dx,dy:this.dy},discarded_counts:{dx:this.clippedX,dy:this.clippedY},game_cursor:{x:this.gameX,y:this.gameY,edge:this.edgeName()},phase:this.phase,pending:this.pending};}
 edgeName(){const sides=[];if(this.gameY===0)sides.push('TOP');if(this.gameY===this.screen.height-1)sides.push('BOTTOM');if(this.gameX===0)sides.push('LEFT');if(this.gameX===this.screen.width-1)sides.push('RIGHT');return sides.length?sides.join('-'):'NONE';}
 events(){return this.history.slice();}
 renderLog(){if(!$('log'))return;$('log').replaceChildren(...this.history.slice(0,11).map(ev=>{const li=document.createElement('li'),t=document.createElement('time');t.textContent=ev.at;li.append(t,document.createTextNode(ev.message));return li;}));}
 render(){if(!$('mouse'))return;const m=$('mouse');m.style.left=(this.x/PAD.w*100)+'%';m.style.top=(this.y/PAD.h*100)+'%';m.classList.toggle('lifted',this.lifted);$('x').textContent=this.x.toFixed(1);$('y').textContent=this.y.toFixed(1);$('contact').textContent=this.lifted?'LIFTED':'ON PAD';$('contact').className=this.lifted?'off':'up';$('phase').textContent=this.phase.toUpperCase();for(const b of ['left','right']){$(b+'Control').classList.toggle('active',this[b]);$(b+'Control').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(this[b]));$(b+'Label').textContent=this[b]?'DOWN / HELD':'UP / RELEASED';$(b+'Mouse').classList.toggle('on',this[b]);} $('countX').textContent=this.dx.toLocaleString();$('countY').textContent=this.dy.toLocaleString();$('lift').disabled=this.lifted;$('place').disabled=!this.lifted;$('regrip').disabled=this.lifted;const g=$('game');const w=g.clientWidth||300,h=g.clientHeight||169,margin=10;const map=([x,y])=>[margin+x/(this.screen.width-1)*(w-2*margin),margin+y/(this.screen.height-1)*(h-2*margin)];const [gx,gy]=map([this.gameX,this.gameY]);$('cross').style.left=gx+'px';$('cross').style.top=gy+'px';const pts=this.trail.slice(-120).map(p=>map(p).join(',')).join(' ');$('trail').setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);$('trailLine').setAttribute('points',pts);$('cursorX').textContent=this.gameX.toLocaleString();$('cursorY').textContent=this.gameY.toLocaleString();$('clippedX').textContent=this.clippedX.toLocaleString();$('clippedY').textContent=this.clippedY.toLocaleString();const edge=this.edgeName();$('edgeIndicator').textContent=edge==='NONE'?'INSIDE SCREEN':edge+' EDGE';$('edgeIndicator').classList.toggle('hit',edge!=='NONE');}
 emit(dx,dy){if(this.lifted)return;this.fx+=dx*DPI/25.4;this.fy+=dy*DPI/25.4;const ix=Math.trunc(this.fx),iy=Math.trunc(this.fy);this.fx-=ix;this.fy-=iy;if(ix||iy){this.dx+=ix;this.dy+=iy;const oldX=this.gameX,oldY=this.gameY;this.gameX=clamp(oldX+ix,0,this.screen.width-1);this.gameY=clamp(oldY+iy,0,this.screen.height-1);const lostX=ix-(this.gameX-oldX),lostY=iy-(this.gameY-oldY);this.clippedX+=lostX;this.clippedY+=lostY;const edge=this.edgeName();if(lostX||lostY){if(edge!==this.edgeNotice){this.note('SCREEN '+edge+' EDGE • cursor stopped; excess movement discarded');this.edgeNotice=edge;}}else this.edgeNotice='';if(this.gameX!==oldX||this.gameY!==oldY){this.trail.push([this.gameX,this.gameY]);if(this.trail.length>150)this.trail.shift();}}}
 applyMove(dx,dy){const nx=clamp(this.x+dx,PAD.minX,PAD.maxX),ny=clamp(this.y+dy,PAD.minY,PAD.maxY);const ax=nx-this.x,ay=ny-this.y;this.x=nx;this.y=ny;this.emit(ax,ay);this.render();}
 manualMove(dx,dy,ms){if(this.pending>0)return;if(this.lifted){this.x=clamp(this.x+dx,PAD.minX,PAD.maxX);this.y=clamp(this.y+dy,PAD.minY,PAD.maxY);this.render();return;}const limit=Math.max(1,MAX_SPEED*Math.max(8,ms)/1000),d=Math.hypot(dx,dy),f=d>limit?limit/d:1;this.phase='manual';this.applyMove(dx*f,dy*f);}
 manualRelocate(x,y){if(!this.lifted || this.pending>0)return;this.x=clamp(x,PAD.minX,PAD.maxX);this.y=clamp(y,PAD.minY,PAD.maxY);this.render();}
 validate(a){if(!a||typeof a!=='object'||Array.isArray(a))throw Error('Expected a JSON command object');if(!['move','move_to','button_down','button_up','lift','relocate','place','regrip','reset','demo','screen_size','center_screen'].includes(a.type))throw Error('Unknown command type');const mm=(k,min,max)=>{if(!Number.isFinite(a[k])||a[k]<min||a[k]>max)throw Error(`${k} must be a finite number from ${min} to ${max}`);};if(a.type==='move'){mm('dx_mm',-2000,2000);mm('dy_mm',-2000,2000);if(a.auto_regrip!==undefined&&typeof a.auto_regrip!=='boolean')throw Error('auto_regrip must be boolean');}if(a.type==='move_to'||a.type==='relocate'){mm('x_mm',0,PAD.w);mm('y_mm',0,PAD.h);}if(a.type==='button_down'||a.type==='button_up'){if(!['left','right'].includes(a.button))throw Error('button must be left or right');}if(a.type==='screen_size'){mm('width',320,7680);mm('height',200,4320);if(!Number.isInteger(a.width)||!Number.isInteger(a.height))throw Error('Screen dimensions must be integers');}}
 run(a){try{this.validate(a);}catch(e){return Promise.reject(e);}if(a.type==='reset')return Promise.resolve(this.reset());this.pending++;const epoch=this.epoch;const task=this.queue.then(async()=>{if(epoch!==this.epoch)throw Error('Command cancelled by reset');await this.exec(a,epoch);return this.state();});this.queue=task.catch(()=>{});return task.finally(()=>{if(epoch===this.epoch){this.pending=Math.max(0,this.pending-1);this.phase=this.lifted?'lifted':'ready';this.render();}});}
 async button(which,down,epoch){if(this[which]===down)return;const now=performance.now(),next=down?this.upAt[which]+45:this.downAt[which]+45; if(next>now)await sleep(next-now);if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;this[which]=down;if(down)this.downAt[which]=performance.now();else this.upAt[which]=performance.now();this.note(which.toUpperCase()+(down?' DOWN / HOLD':' UP / RELEASE'));this.render();}
 async leg(dx,dy,epoch){const dist=Math.hypot(dx,dy);if(dist<.00001)return;const ux=dx/dist,uy=dy/dist;const duration=Math.max(.06,1.875*dist/MAX_SPEED,Math.sqrt(5.7735*dist/MAX_ACCEL),Math.cbrt(60*dist/MAX_JERK));const steps=Math.ceil(duration*1000/TICK),stepms=duration*1000/steps;this.phase='moving';let prev=0;for(let k=1;k<=steps;k++){if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;const t=k/steps,blend=t*t*t*(10+t*(-15+6*t)),progress=dist*blend;this.applyMove((progress-prev)*ux,(progress-prev)*uy);prev=progress;await sleep(stepms);}this.phase='ready';}
 async regrip(epoch){if(this.lifted)throw Error('Place the mouse before regripping');const x=this.x,y=this.y;this.lifted=true;this.phase='regripping';this.note('LIFT • input motion paused');this.render();await sleep(85);for(let i=1;i<=18;i++){if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;const t=(1-Math.cos(Math.PI*i/18))/2;this.x=x+(160-x)*t;this.y=y+(120-y)*t;this.render();await sleep(11);}if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;await sleep(70);this.lifted=false;this.phase='ready';this.note('PLACE • regrip, 0 counts while lifted');this.render();}
 async move(dx,dy,auto,epoch){if(this.lifted)throw Error('Cannot send movement while lifted: place mouse first');let dist=Math.hypot(dx,dy);if(dist<.0001)return;const original=dist,ux=dx/dist,uy=dy/dist;let grips=0;while(dist>.001){if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;let available=dist;if(ux>0)available=Math.min(available,Math.max(0,(PAD.maxX-this.x)/ux));if(ux<0)available=Math.min(available,Math.max(0,(PAD.minX-this.x)/ux));if(uy>0)available=Math.min(available,Math.max(0,(PAD.maxY-this.y)/uy));if(uy<0)available=Math.min(available,Math.max(0,(PAD.minY-this.y)/uy));if(available>1e-5){await this.leg(available*ux,available*uy,epoch);dist-=available;}if(dist>.001){this.note('PAD EDGE • '+(auto?'auto-regrip':'stopped'));if(!auto)break;if(++grips>25)throw Error('Too many regrips');await this.regrip(epoch);}}if(epoch===this.epoch)this.note('MOVE '+(original-dist).toFixed(1)+' mm'+(grips?' • '+grips+' regrip(s)':''));}
 async centerScreen(epoch){
  if(this.lifted)throw Error('Place the mouse before recentering the screen cursor');
  const tx=Math.floor(this.screen.width/2),ty=Math.floor(this.screen.height/2);
  this.note('SCREEN RECENTER • moving with relative mouse input');
  for(let attempt=0;attempt<3;attempt++){
   if(epoch!==this.epoch)return;
   const cx=tx-this.gameX,cy=ty-this.gameY;
   if(cx===0&&cy===0)break;
   // Account for sub-count fractions so that rounding reaches the target pixel.
   const mmx=cx===0?0:(cx+Math.sign(cx)*.25-this.fx)*25.4/DPI;
   const mmy=cy===0?0:(cy+Math.sign(cy)*.25-this.fy)*25.4/DPI;
   await this.move(mmx,mmy,true,epoch);
  }
  if(epoch===this.epoch)this.note(`SCREEN CENTER ${this.gameX},${this.gameY} • physical motion only`);
 }
 async exec(a,epoch){switch(a.type){case'move':return this.move(a.dx_mm,a.dy_mm,a.auto_regrip!==false,epoch);case'move_to':return this.move(a.x_mm-this.x,a.y_mm-this.y,false,epoch);case'button_down':return this.button(a.button,true,epoch);case'button_up':return this.button(a.button,false,epoch);case'lift':this.lifted=true;this.phase='lifted';this.note('LIFT • input motion paused');this.render();return;case'place':this.lifted=false;this.phase='ready';this.note('PLACE • input resumed');this.render();return;case'relocate':if(!this.lifted)throw Error('Lift the mouse before relocating');this.x=clamp(a.x_mm,PAD.minX,PAD.maxX);this.y=clamp(a.y_mm,PAD.minY,PAD.maxY);this.note('RELOCATE • 0 input counts');this.render();return;case'regrip':return this.regrip(epoch);case'center_screen':return this.centerScreen(epoch);case'reset':return this.reset();case'screen_size':this.screen={width:a.width,height:a.height};this.gameX=Math.floor(a.width/2);this.gameY=Math.floor(a.height/2);this.trail=[[this.gameX,this.gameY]];this.edgeNotice='';this.note('SCREEN '+a.width+'×'+a.height+' • cursor centered');this.render();return;case'demo':await this.move(106,-32,true,epoch);await this.button('left',true,epoch);await this.move(255,70,true,epoch);await this.button('left',false,epoch);await this.button('right',true,epoch);await sleep(300);await this.button('right',false,epoch);this.note('DEMO complete');return;}}
 reset(){this.epoch++;this.pending=0;this.queue=Promise.resolve();this.x=160;this.y=120;this.lifted=false;this.left=false;this.right=false;this.dx=0;this.dy=0;this.fx=0;this.fy=0;this.gameX=Math.floor(this.screen.width/2);this.gameY=Math.floor(this.screen.height/2);this.clippedX=0;this.clippedY=0;this.edgeNotice='';this.trail=[[this.gameX,this.gameY]];this.phase='ready';this.note('RESET preview');this.render();return this.state();}
}
const core=new MouseLab();
const showError=e=>{const el=$('status');el.textContent=(e&&e.message)||String(e);el.classList.add('error');};
const ok=s=>{const el=$('status');el.textContent=s;el.classList.remove('error');};
const dispatch=a=>core.run(a).then(s=>{ok('Done: '+a.type+' • '+s.phase);return s;}).catch(e=>{showError(e);throw e;});
function fire(a){dispatch(a).catch(()=>{});}
const api={run:a=>dispatch(a),down:button=>dispatch({type:'button_down',button}),up:button=>dispatch({type:'button_up',button}),move:(dx_mm,dy_mm,auto_regrip=true)=>dispatch({type:'move',dx_mm,dy_mm,auto_regrip}),screen:(width,height)=>dispatch({type:'screen_size',width,height}),lift:()=>dispatch({type:'lift'}),place:()=>dispatch({type:'place'}),relocate:(x_mm,y_mm)=>dispatch({type:'relocate',x_mm,y_mm}),regrip:()=>dispatch({type:'regrip'}),centerScreen:()=>dispatch({type:'center_screen'}),demo:()=>dispatch({type:'demo'}),reset:()=>{const s=core.reset();ok('Preview reset');return Promise.resolve(s);},state:()=>core.state(),events:()=>core.events()};
Object.defineProperty(window,'mouseAI',{value:Object.freeze(api),configurable:false,writable:false});
for(const b of ['left','right'])$(b+'Control').addEventListener('click',()=>fire({type:core[b]?'button_up':'button_down',button:b}));
for(const [id,dx,dy] of [['moveLeft',-120,0],['moveRight',120,0],['moveUp',0,-80],['moveDown',0,80]])$(id).onclick=()=>fire({type:'move',dx_mm:dx,dy_mm:dy,auto_regrip:$('autoregrip').checked});
$('resolution').onchange=e=>{const [width,height]=e.target.value.split('x').map(Number);fire({type:'screen_size',width,height});$('game').style.aspectRatio=width+'/'+height;};$('lift').onclick=()=>fire({type:'lift'});$('place').onclick=()=>fire({type:'place'});$('regrip').onclick=()=>fire({type:'regrip'});$('centerScreen').onclick=()=>fire({type:'center_screen'});$('demo').onclick=()=>fire({type:'demo'});$('reset').onclick=()=>{core.reset();ok('Preview reset')};
$('execute').onclick=()=>{try{fire(JSON.parse($('command').value));}catch(e){showError(e);}};
$('sampleHold').onclick=()=>{$('command').value='{"type":"button_down","button":"left"}';};
$('sampleLift').onclick=()=>{$('command').value='{"type":"lift"}';};
$('export').onclick=()=>{const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({state:core.state(),events:core.events()},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mouse-events.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),500);};
// Dragging the background moves the physical mouse on the pad. Drag while lifted to reposition with no game motion.
for(const b of ['left','right'])$(b+'Mouse').addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{e.stopPropagation();e.preventDefault();fire({type:core[b]?'button_up':'button_down',button:b});});
const pad=$('pad');let drag=null;function point(e){const r=pad.getBoundingClientRect();return{x:(e.clientX-r.left)/r.width*PAD.w,y:(e.clientY-r.top)/r.height*PAD.h};}
pad.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.leftBtn,.rightBtn'))return;e.preventDefault();pad.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);drag={id:e.pointerId,pt:point(e),time:performance.now()};});
pad.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!drag||e.pointerId!==drag.id)return;const p=point(e),t=performance.now(),dt=t-drag.time;if(core.lifted)core.manualRelocate(p.x,p.y);else core.manualMove(p.x-drag.pt.x,p.y-drag.pt.y,dt);drag.pt=p;drag.time=t;});
function endDrag(e){if(drag&&e.pointerId===drag.id){drag=null;core.phase=core.lifted?'lifted':'ready';core.render();}}
pad.addEventListener('pointerup',endDrag);pad.addEventListener('pointercancel',endDrag);
window.addEventListener('resize',()=>core.render());
})();
